cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001 in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001: ISO 20022 payment file generation and validation"
abstract: >-
  A Python library, CLI, REST API, MCP server and language server that
  generate and validate ISO 20022 pain.001 and pain.008 payment files
  from CSV, SQLite, JSON, JSON Lines and Parquet, with scheme rulebook
  validation for SEPA, cross-border and cross-record checks.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.71"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/pain001"
url: "https://pain001.com"
keywords:
  - ISO 20022
  - pain.001
  - pain.008
  - SEPA
  - payments
  - fintech
